<h1>All About Cheddar Cheese</h1>

<p>Welcome to my website about cheddar cheese!</p>

<h2>What Is Cheddar Cheese?</h2>

<p>
    Cheddar is a popular cheese made from cow's milk.
    It has a firm texture and can have a mild or sharp flavor.
</p>

<h2>History of Cheddar Cheese</h2>

<p>
    Cheddar cheese originated in Somerset, England.
    Today, it is enjoyed by people all around the world.
</p>

<h2>Types of Cheddar Cheese</h2>

<p><strong>Mild Cheddar:</strong> Has a smooth, gentle flavor.</p>

<p><strong>Sharp Cheddar:</strong> Has a stronger, tangier flavor.</p>

<p><strong>Extra Sharp Cheddar:</strong> Has a more intense flavor.</p>

<h2>Fun Facts</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Cheddar originated in England.</li>
    <li>Cheddar can be white or orange.</li>
    <li>Cheddar is commonly used in grilled cheese sandwiches.</li>
    <li>Aging cheddar changes its flavor and texture.</li>
</ul>

